Description: Use Echo's libraries alongside four privately installed dependencies
 Upstream pins describe its uv environment, not the APIs used by the application.
 Keep unavailable dependencies pinned in the private venv and use the distro
 libraries for the remainder. Declare directly imported libraries explicitly.
 The build checks the resulting dependency closure and runs offline tests.
Author: Parrot Dev Team <team@parrotsec.org>
Forwarded: not-needed

